            "width": "100%",
            "bgtext": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "subtitle": "SET BY HAND",
            "title": "Small enough to overlook. We don't.",
            "size_text": "h2",
            "text": "",
            "answer_content": "<p>Every stone is hand-set into its prong, checked under magnification, and paired with a chain finished to resist tarnish — because a necklace worn every day has to survive every day.</p><p>Nothing is pulled from a bin of pre-made pendants. Yours is set only once you've confirmed the month, the name, and the length — one piece, made for one person.</p>",
            "style_btn": "btn-underline btn-underline-white",
            "button": "",
